  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/EH9RXWf.png\" alt=\"標題\"></p><p>\n  <a href=\"https://github.com/NotToBlame/Mini-Me-Totem\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/GitHub-0C0D0F?logo=github&amp;style=for-the-badge\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fko-fi.com%252fNotToBlame\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Ko--Fi-0C0D0F?logo=kofi&amp;style=for-the-badge\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://twitch.tv/NotToBlame\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Twitch-0C0D0F?logo=twitch&amp;style=for-the-badge\">\n  </a>\n  <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2kprrpbDfK\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n    <img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Support-0C0D0F?logo=discord&amp;style=for-the-badge\">\n  </a>\n</p><p><strong>🧸 迷你版我圖騰</strong> 是一個輕量級材質包，將不死圖騰替換為你 Minecraft 皮膚的小巧Q版造型。</p><h2>特色</h2><ul>\n<li>使用你自己的皮膚作為圖騰模型</li>\n<li>設定簡單——只需替換一個檔案</li>\n<li>非常適合內容創作者或個人化用途</li>\n<li>與其他材質包相容，且效能友好</li>\n</ul><h2>設定步驟</h2><ol>\n<li>下載你的 Minecraft 皮膚（例如從 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fnamemc.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">NameMC</a> 或 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fminecraftskins.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">MinecraftSkins</a>）。</li>\n<li>替換以下位置的檔案：<ul>\n<li><code>assets/minecraft/textures/item/totem_of_undying.png</code>（適用於 1.13 以上版本）</li>\n<li>或 <code>assets/minecraft/textures/item/totem.png</code>（適用於 1.13 以下版本）</li></ul></li>\n<li>儲存後在 Minecraft 中載入材質包即可。</li>\n</ol><h2>預覽</h2><p>\n  <strong>預設皮膚</strong><br>\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/cGJf4uI.png\" width=\"500\">\n</p><p>\n  <strong>自訂皮膚</strong><br>\n  <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/DqLfoIE.png\" width=\"500\">\n</p><h2>支援</h2><p>如需協助或回報錯誤，請在 <a href=\"https://github.com/NotToBlame/mini-me-totem/issues\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub</a> 提出問題，或加入 <a href=\"https://discord.gg/2kprrpbDfK\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord 伺服器</a>。</p>",
